{"reference":"Hebrews 6","book":"Hebrews","chapter":6,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A Severe Warning","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Verses 4–8 use deliberately severe language: people who have experienced spiritual realities and then “fell away” are described as impossible to renew, and the warning is reinforced by the contrast between fruitful land and land producing thorns. The passage’s force should be taken seriously, but its rhetoric does not authorize terrorizing people, declaring victims irredeemable, or using spiritual abuse.","verse_refs":["Hebrews 6:4-12"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_hebrews_006_01160e5eee8e0c4cc06f3315"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"cultural_context","title":"Hope Grounded in God’s Promise","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"The chapter turns from warning to encouragement through God’s promise and oath. Hope is pictured as an anchor that reaches “within the veil,” where Jesus has entered as a forerunner and priest. The imagery directs confidence toward God’s dependable promise and calls for endurance; it is not a basis for giving leaders or institutions unconditional trust.","verse_refs":["Hebrews 6:13-20"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_hebrews_006_18db81baa2d5a0ebb5f99dd4"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"inference"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"A Witness to Hebrews","blocks":[{"id":"block_3","text":"Papyrus 46 is an early substantial manuscript witness to Hebrews, although parts of it are missing and its date can only be estimated approximately from its handwriting. Codex Sinaiticus also preserves Hebrews in its New Testament sequence after 2 Thessalonians.","verse_refs":["Hebrews 10:1-39","Hebrews 11:1-40","Hebrews 12:1-29","Hebrews 13:1-25","Hebrews 1:1-14","Hebrews 2:1-18","Hebrews 3:1-19","Hebrews 4:1-16","Hebrews 5:1-14","Hebrews 5:11-14","Hebrews 7:1-28","Hebrews 8:1-13","Hebrews 9:1-28"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_hebrews_006_89dfebcfa450625b80592f70"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}